  ["forever.warrior-protection.split"] = "the last 20 points. Icy Veins puts them in Fury, Kargoz takes more Protection, and this page does both: Fury's first three rows and then Protection's leftovers. Defiance is the point-sink Warcraft Tavern uses, and Improved Thunder Clap is the other if you do not run dungeons.",
  ["forever.warrior.advice.damage"] = "Arms is the build this page advises, for groups and for chains of monsters. The price: it needs a two-hander. Fury is the other damage build and grinds single monsters well, but it is weak until about level 36.",
  ["forever.warrior.advice.tank"] = "Protection is also the build most guides level alone with, from about level 16. The price: it kills more slowly than the damage builds, and it needs a shield.",
  ["forever.warrior.ov.bad"] = "Reach. Charge works once a fight and a monster that runs needs Hamstring or Intercept. You have no healing of your own beyond Victory Rush and bandages.",
  ["forever.warrior.ov.good"] = "Tools that need no rest. Charge starts a fight with rage in hand, and from level 20 Victory Rush heals you after a kill.",
  ["forever.warrior.ov.levelling"] = "Charge, your hardest hit when it is ready, then Heroic Strike with the rage you would waste. Chain your kills so Victory Rush is always ready.",
  ["forever.warrior.ov.resource"] = "Rage. It builds when you hit and when you are hit, a critical hit gives more than a plain one, and it fades when the fight stops. Tactical Mastery from level 14 keeps some of it when you change stance.",
  ["forever.warrior.ov.ten"] = "You get your first talent point. Pick damage or tank and Primer shows the build and your first three picks. A respec costs gold, so choose what you will do most.",
  ["forever.warrior.ov.who"] = "You fight in melee, in whichever stance the job wants. The rage you spend comes from hitting and from being hit.",
  ["forever.warrior.role.damage"] = "Arms takes groups with Sweeping Strikes and a two-hander, and Mortal Strike comes at 40. Fury grinds single monsters well but is weak until about level 36.",
  ["forever.warrior.role.tank"] = "The only tanking build, and the one most guides level alone with from about level 16. It kills more slowly than the damage builds.",
  ["mage"] = "A mage does damage with a cast bar and a mana bar, and the craft is in what to cast and when to stand still. Frost slows and freezes, Fire hits hardest, Arcane saves mana. Every line below presses a button.",
  ["mage-arcane.intro"] = "Arcane runs on mana and on spells that cost nothing. It is slow before 40 and good after, for a mage who would rather cast than flee.",
  ["mage-arcane.line"] = "Arcane runs on mana and on spells that cost nothing.",
  ["mage-arcane.note"] = "(31 points in Arcane for Arcane Power, then 20 in Fire).",
  ["mage-arcane.p1"] = "Arcane spells are resisted 10% less.",
  ["mage-arcane.p10"] = "Spells deal 30% more damage and cost 30% more mana for 15 seconds. Every 3 minutes.",
  ["mage-arcane.p11"] = "Fireball casts 0.5 seconds faster.",
  ["mage-arcane.p12"] = "Fire spells have a 10% chance to stun for 2 seconds.",
  ["mage-arcane.p13"] = "A critical Fire hit sets the target burning for 40% more.",
  ["mage-arcane.p14"] = "Fire spells reach 6 yards further.",
  ["mage-arcane.p15"] = "Fire Blast comes back 1.5 seconds sooner.",
  ["mage-arcane.p2"] = "Any damage spell has a 10% chance to make the next one cost nothing.",
  ["mage-arcane.p3"] = "Arcane Missiles is not broken when you are hit.",
  ["mage-arcane.p4"] = "15% of your mana regeneration continues while you cast.",
  ["mage-arcane.p5"] = "Armour equal to half your Intellect. It opens Arcane Mind.",
  ["mage-arcane.p6"] = "Counterspell silences the target for 4 seconds, every time.",
  ["mage-arcane.p7"] = "Your next spell with a cast under 10 seconds becomes instant. Every 3 minutes.",
  ["mage-arcane.p8"] = "10% more mana.",
  ["mage-arcane.p9"] = "3% more spell damage and critical chance.",
  ["mage-arcane.s1.opening"] = "Frost Armor on, Arcane Intellect, Frostbolt from range, step back as it slows, Fire Blast to finish. Wand when mana runs low.",
  ["mage-arcane.s1.r1"] = "Put it on yourself. It adds armour for 30 minutes, so renew it between fights and not in them.",
  ["mage-arcane.s1.r2"] = "Cast it on yourself. 30 minutes of extra Intellect means more mana to spend.",
  ["mage-arcane.s1.r3"] = "Your opener at 35 yards. The cast takes longer with each rank, so you want the monster far away when it starts.",
  ["mage-arcane.s1.r4"] = "Opens at 30 yards and slows the monster by 40% for 5 seconds. It arrives later and you cast again before it does.",
  ["mage-arcane.s1.r5"] = "Press it as the monster arrives or runs. It has no cast bar, so it fills the gap between casts.",
  ["mage-arcane.s1.r6"] = "Hits once a second for 3 seconds, and you cannot move for any of it. Use it only when nothing will reach you while it lasts.",
  ["mage-arcane.s1.r7"] = "A sheep for up to 20 seconds. It works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters, and any damage wakes it, so leave it alone.",
  ["mage-arcane.s1.r8"] = "Make drinks before you need them. Sitting with one brings mana back and saves a vendor trip.",
  ["mage-arcane.s1.r9"] = "Makes food. Eat between fights to get health back without spending any mana.",
  ["mage-arcane.s2"] = "One monster, levelling. The page is the untalented kit's until the tree helps.",
  ["mage-arcane.s2.r1"] = "Your opener at 30 yards. It slows the monster by 40%.",
  ["mage-arcane.s2.r2"] = "Your hit when the monster is held or you have mana to spare.",
  ["mage-arcane.s2.r3"] = "Hits once a second for 3 seconds. When Arcane Concentration makes your next spell free, cast it, because it costs nothing.",
  ["mage-arcane.s2.r4"] = "Freeze it, step back and keep casting, because a frozen monster cannot hit you.",
  ["mage-arcane.s2.r5"] = "No cast bar, ready every 8 seconds.",
  ["mage-arcane.s2.r6"] = "Hits everything around you at once, so use it when a second monster joins.",
  ["mage-arcane.s2.r7"] = "Turn one into a sheep for up to 20 seconds, so you fight one at a time.",
  ["mage-arcane.s3"] = "One monster, or two, and the first dungeons.",
  ["mage-arcane.s3.opening"] = "Arcane Missiles when it is free, else Frostbolt, Frost Nova if it reaches you.",
  ["mage-arcane.s3.r1"] = "A free cast is the best moment for it. It hits once a second for 4 to 5 seconds.",
  ["mage-arcane.s3.r2"] = "Your slow and your main hit while Arcane Concentration has not made a spell free.",
  ["mage-arcane.s3.r3"] = "Stops that spell and all of the same kind (Fire, Frost) for 10 seconds, and silences for 4 with the talent.",
  ["mage-arcane.s3.r4"] = "8 seconds of standing still for mana. 8 minutes to come back.",
  ["mage-arcane.s3.r5"] = "Absorbs damage by draining mana instead.",
  ["mage-arcane.s3.r6"] = "Moves you 20 yards and frees you from stuns.",
  ["mage-arcane.s3.r7"] = "Your next spell is instant. Use it on the biggest cast you have.",
  ["mage-arcane.s3.r8"] = "Freeze it, step back and keep casting, because a frozen monster cannot hit you.",
  ["mage-arcane.s4"] = "Dungeons, hard monsters and the first raid.",
  ["mage-arcane.s4.opening"] = "Arcane Power on the fight that matters, Presence of Mind on the biggest cast, Arcane Missiles on every free spell.",
  ["mage-arcane.s4.r1"] = "Spells deal 30% more for 15 seconds and cost 30% more mana. Every 3 minutes, so spend it on the one that counts.",
  ["mage-arcane.s4.r2"] = "An instant cast, every 3 minutes. Use it on the biggest cast.",
  ["mage-arcane.s4.r3"] = "Cast it whenever Arcane Concentration makes a spell free, because 5 seconds of damage costs nothing.",
  ["mage-arcane.s4.r4"] = "The cheap hit that slows. Use it between free casts.",
  ["mage-arcane.s4.r5"] = "Hits everything around you at once, so use it when a second monster joins.",
  ["mage-arcane.s4.r6"] = "Stops the spell, and Improved Counterspell silences the monster for 4 seconds.",
  ["mage-arcane.s4.r7"] = "8 seconds of standing still. 8 minutes to come back.",
  ["mage-arcane.s4.r8"] = "Keeps 30% of mana regeneration going while you cast.",
  ["mage-arcane.split"] = "the last 20 points. A second road puts them in Frost (Improved Frostbolt, Frostbite, Permafrost) for a mage who needs the slow. This page takes Fire for the harder hit, and the price is the slow that keeps you alive.",
  ["mage-fire.dry"] = "Combustion held back is a lot of critical hits not dealt.",
  ["mage-fire.intro"] = "Fire hits hardest and sets the monster burning. It has no slow of its own, so the page gives you Frostbolt and Frost Nova for distance.",
  ["mage-fire.line"] = "Fire hits hardest and sets the monster burning.",
  ["mage-fire.note"] = "(31 points in Fire for Combustion, then 20 in Frost).",
  ["mage-fire.p1"] = "Fireball casts 0.5 seconds faster, and it is your main button.",
  ["mage-fire.p10"] = "10% more Fire damage.",
  ["mage-fire.p11"] = "Each Fire hit raises your critical chance by 10% until you have had 3 criticals. Every 3 minutes.",
  ["mage-fire.p12"] = "A Fire or Frost spell is 6% less likely to be resisted.",
  ["mage-fire.p13"] = "Frostbolt casts 0.5 seconds faster, so the slow you rely on comes sooner.",
  ["mage-fire.p14"] = "A chilled monster has a 15% chance to freeze for 5 seconds.",
  ["mage-fire.p15"] = "Frost Nova comes back 4 seconds sooner.",
  ["mage-fire.p16"] = "A chill lasts 3 seconds longer and slows 10% more.",
  ["mage-fire.p17"] = "Finishes the cooldown on all your Frost spells. Every 10 minutes.",
  ["mage-fire.p18"] = "Frost spells cost 15% less mana and draw 30% less threat.",
  ["mage-fire.p2"] = "A critical Fire hit sets the target burning for another 40% of the damage over 4 seconds.",
  ["mage-fire.p3"] = "A big hit with a 6 second cast, and a burn after it. Open with it from 35 yards.",
  ["mage-fire.p4"] = "Fire spells reach 6 yards further, so you open from further away.",
  ["mage-fire.p5"] = "Fire Blast and Scorch are 4% more likely to be critical.",
  ["mage-fire.p6"] = "A critical Fire or Frost spell gives back 30% of its mana.",
  ["mage-fire.p7"] = "A Scorch makes the target take 3% more Fire damage, stacking to 5 times.",
  ["mage-fire.p8"] = "6% more critical chance on Fire spells.",
  ["mage-fire.p9"] = "Damages and dazes all enemies near you, every 45 seconds.",
  ["mage-fire.s1.opening"] = "Frost Armor on, Arcane Intellect, Frostbolt from range, step back as it slows, Fire Blast to finish. Wand when mana runs low.",
  ["mage-fire.s1.r1"] = "Put it on yourself. It adds armour for 30 minutes, so renew it between fights and not in them.",
  ["mage-fire.s1.r2"] = "Cast it on yourself. 30 minutes of extra Intellect means more mana to spend.",
  ["mage-fire.s1.r3"] = "Your opener at 35 yards. The cast takes longer with each rank, so you want the monster far away when it starts.",
  ["mage-fire.s1.r4"] = "Opens at 30 yards and slows the monster by 40% for 5 seconds. It arrives later and you cast again before it does.",
  ["mage-fire.s1.r5"] = "Press it as the monster arrives or runs. It has no cast bar, so it fills the gap between casts.",
  ["mage-fire.s1.r6"] = "Hits once a second for 3 seconds, and you cannot move for any of it. Use it only when nothing will reach you while it lasts.",
  ["mage-fire.s1.r7"] = "A sheep for up to 20 seconds. It works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters, and any damage wakes it, so leave it alone.",
  ["mage-fire.s1.r8"] = "Make drinks before you need them. Sitting with one brings mana back and saves a vendor trip.",
  ["mage-fire.s1.r9"] = "Makes food. Eat between fights to get health back without spending any mana.",
  ["mage-fire.s2"] = "One monster, levelling.",
  ["mage-fire.s2.opening"] = "Frost Armor, Fireball from 35 yards, Fireball, Frost Nova when it arrives, walk back, cast, Fire Blast.",
  ["mage-fire.s2.r1"] = "Your main button, from 35 yards. A critical one sets the monster burning.",
  ["mage-fire.s2.r2"] = "When you need it slowed. It costs less than Fireball at the same rank, so it is also the cheaper hit.",
  ["mage-fire.s2.r3"] = "Freezes it for up to 8 seconds. Walk back, because damage breaks the freeze and the point is distance.",
  ["mage-fire.s2.r4"] = "Ready every 8 seconds with no cast bar. It finishes a fight, and a critical one starts Ignite.",
  ["mage-fire.s2.r5"] = "Hits everything around you at once, so use it when a second monster joins.",
  ["mage-fire.s2.r6"] = "Turn one into a sheep for up to 20 seconds, so you fight one at a time.",
  ["mage-fire.s3"] = "One monster, or two, and the first dungeons.",
  ["mage-fire.s3.opening"] = "Pyroblast from 35 yards, Fireball, Frost Nova if it reaches you, Fire Blast.",
  ["mage-fire.s3.r1"] = "A 6 second cast and a burn after it. Open with it from 35 yards, because it lands before the monster can reach you.",
  ["mage-fire.s3.r10"] = "8 seconds of standing still for mana. 8 minutes to come back.",
  ["mage-fire.s3.r2"] = "The main button. Its cast time grows with rank, so open with your highest rank and finish with lower ones.",
  ["mage-fire.s3.r3"] = "A 1.5 second cast that costs far less than a Fireball of the same level. Use it to finish a monster when mana is short.",
  ["mage-fire.s3.r4"] = "Instant. Press it when it reaches you or runs.",
  ["mage-fire.s3.r5"] = "Freezes it for up to 8 seconds. Step back and keep casting, because it cannot hit you.",
  ["mage-fire.s3.r6"] = "A 3 second cast on the ground, burning for 8 seconds. It is how you open on a group at range.",
  ["mage-fire.s3.r7"] = "Damages and dazes all near you, every 45 seconds. Use it when a pack arrives.",
  ["mage-fire.s3.r8"] = "Absorbs Fire damage for 30 seconds. Only press it for a monster that casts fire.",
  ["mage-fire.s3.r9"] = "Stops that spell and all of the same kind (Fire, Frost) for 10 seconds.",
  ["mage-fire.s4"] = "Dungeons, hard monsters and the first raid.",
  ["mage-fire.s4.opening"] = "Scorch for the stacks (when the target is worth it), Fireball, Pyroblast, Combustion for the fight that matters.",
  ["mage-fire.s4.r1"] = "The main button. It casts for 3.5 seconds from rank 5, or 3 with Improved Fireball, so start it early.",
  ["mage-fire.s4.r2"] = "Use it early, up to 5 times. Each stack adds Fire damage taken, and it is only worth it if the monster lives long enough.",
  ["mage-fire.s4.r3"] = "A 6 second cast and a burn after it. Open with it.",
  ["mage-fire.s4.r4"] = "Each Fire hit raises your critical chance until you have had 3 criticals. It takes 3 minutes to come back, so choose the fight.",
  ["mage-fire.s4.r5"] = "Instant, every 8 seconds.",
  ["mage-fire.s4.r6"] = "Damages and dazes everything near, every 45 seconds.",
  ["mage-fire.s4.r7"] = "A 3 second cast on the ground and a burn.",
  ["mage-fire.s4.r8"] = "Freeze it, step back and keep casting, because a frozen monster cannot hit you.",
  ["mage-fire.s4.r9"] = "Absorbs Fire damage for 30 seconds.",
  ["mage-fire.split"] = "the last 20 points. A second road puts them in Arcane (Arcane Focus, Arcane Concentration, Arcane Subtlety) for a mage who wants free spells and a bigger mana bar. It gives up the slow and the freeze, which are what keeps a Fire mage alive when the monster arrives. This page takes Frost for that reason.",
  ["mage-frost.hc1"] = "Cast from as far as you can reach, and keep moving back. One monster at a time.",
  ["mage-frost.hc2"] = "Frost Nova when a monster reaches you, then Blink or walk away before you bandage.",
  ["mage-frost.hc3"] = "Polymorph the second monster at once, and let a runner go.",
  ["mage-frost.hc4"] = "Ice Block is a last resort: decide your next move before you press it.",
  ["mage-frost.intro"] = "Frost keeps the monster slow or frozen so it hits you less, and kills with Frostbolt. It is the mage that survives being alone.",
  ["mage-frost.line"] = "Slows and freezes so the monster hits you less, and kills with Frostbolt. The mage that survives being alone.",
  ["mage-frost.note"] = "(34 points in Frost for Ice Barrier, then 17 in Arcane for mana.)",
  ["mage-frost.p1"] = "Your Frost and Fire spells are resisted less, and every guide takes it first.",
  ["mage-frost.p10"] = "The rest of Improved Frostbolt: faster casts on your main button.",
  ["mage-frost.p11"] = "Frost spells cost less mana, and mana is what ends a mage's day.",
  ["mage-frost.p12"] = "Frost spells do more damage.",
  ["mage-frost.p13"] = "A shield on you that absorbs damage for a minute, and spells are not interrupted while it holds.",
  ["mage-frost.p14"] = "The last point of Piercing Ice.",
  ["mage-frost.p15"] = "Frostbolt and Blizzard reach further, so you start the pull from further away.",
  ["mage-frost.p16"] = "The target resists your spells less. Mostly the way to the next row.",
  ["mage-frost.p17"] = "Arcane spells are resisted less. Mostly the way to Arcane Concentration.",
  ["mage-frost.p18"] = "A damage spell can make your next cast cost nothing.",
  ["mage-frost.p19"] = "Armour equal to half your Intellect.",
  ["mage-frost.p2"] = "Frostbolt casts faster, and it is your main button.",
  ["mage-frost.p20"] = "More damage with a wand, and a wand costs no mana.",
  ["mage-frost.p21"] = "Arcane Explosion crits more often. These points open the next row.",
  ["mage-frost.p22"] = "Part of your mana regeneration continues while you cast.",
  ["mage-frost.p3"] = "A chilled monster can freeze for a moment. Take it for one monster at a time.",
  ["mage-frost.p4"] = "Your Frost critical hits do more damage.",
  ["mage-frost.p5"] = "The rest of Ice Shards: it is in every build that fights one monster.",
  ["mage-frost.p6"] = "Frost Nova comes back sooner, and Shatter needs it.",
  ["mage-frost.p7"] = "Spells crit more often against a frozen monster. Frost Nova, then Frostbolt on what it froze, is the heart of this build.",
  ["mage-frost.p8"] = "Safe from everything for 10 seconds, and you cannot act. It is a talent, not a trainer spell.",
  ["mage-frost.p9"] = "It brings back all your Frost cooldowns at once, so Ice Block can be used twice.",
